<http://data.silknow.org/event/9bf195c4-ee37-3233-8cd9-c8ddb07a9f44>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This <i>fukusa</i> was presented to an Englishman, William Rogers, at the Emperor's Palace in Japan in 1874. His sister gave it to the Museum in 1923.\n\nRegistered File number 1923/1658."@en ;
